 "_about": "Each industry issuer's tags: the words that, standing as whole tokens in a title, say the title is that issuer's (kb/_build_exhibits_review.py issuer_named). Derived once on 2026-11-13 (S648) from every issuer in kb/credentials.json and kb/credential_review_overlay.json: a parenthetical that is one token (ASE, NREMT), and an all-capitals word outside parentheses (IPC); then written down and corrected by hand: generic ones dropped (ROP, HS, DUI, GIS, 'varies'), split ones joined (CAL-OSHA, EC-Council, H&R Block), and brands that sit outside the issuer's short tag added (CAL FIRE, Cal OES, UC ANR, Disney, LEED, Esri, Haas, Unity, LPIC, CLEP, DSST). The S648 conductor's direction on #3241: the issuer list is finite, so its tags are data, never a pattern. An issuer missing here has no tags: its titles count as named only on the words of its name. Add an issuer when the reference gains one.",
